<div class="text-center py-5">
  <h1 class="display-5 fw-bold"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_NAME", "UnityOffers Demo") %></h1>
  <p class="lead text-muted mt-2"><%= ENV.fetch("APP_TAGLINE", "") %></p>
  <p class="text-muted mx-auto mt-3" style="max-width: 640px;">
    Asking is harder than offering, so the words people use to ask usually apologise. Write what you could use the
    way it comes out. The need translator turns it into a plain, confident request for your community board, tells
    you what it changed, asks for one missing detail, and suggests two or three swap ideas. No money, no prices, and
    it never decides what is even: you and the other person do.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-4 d-flex justify-content-center gap-3">
    <% if signed_in? %>
      <%= link_to "Go to my needs", needs_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
    <% else %>
      <%= link_to "Try it free", sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
      <%= link_to "Sign in", sign_in_path, class: "btn btn-outline-secondary btn-lg" %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="my-5 opacity-25">

<div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 860px;">
  <h2 class="h5 text-muted text-center mb-4">Example &mdash; a fictional neighbour on Thornbury Road</h2>

  <div class="card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <p class="text-muted small mb-1">Their words</p>
      <p class="mb-0 fst-italic">
        &ldquo;Sorry to ask, I know everyone&rsquo;s busy. My car died last month and I&rsquo;ve got a pile of
        flattened boxes and an old bookcase that need to go to the recycling centre. I feel bad asking but I
        can&rsquo;t carry them on the bus.&rdquo;
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card listing-card mb-3">
    <div class="card-body">
      <div class="mb-2">
        <span class="badge kind-badge">Request</span>
        <span class="badge request-badge">Rides</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="h5 mb-2">Lift to the recycling centre</h3>
      <p class="mb-0">
        I could use a lift to the recycling centre with a pile of flattened boxes and an old bookcase. My car is off
        the road and they are too bulky for the bus. Any Saturday this month works, and it should take about two hours.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="alert alert-secondary py-2 small mb-4">
    <strong>One detail to add:</strong> Which recycling centre is it, so a driver knows how far the trip is?
  </div>

  <h3 class="h6 mb-2">Swap ideas</h3>
  <div class="row g-3 small">
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card h-100 swap-card"><div class="card-body">
        You drive me and the boxes to the recycling centre one Saturday; I hem or mend two things for you.
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card h-100 swap-card"><div class="card-body">
        You give me the lift and a hand with the bookcase; I keep an hour of sewing repairs for you whenever you need it.
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-md-4">
      <div class="card h-100 swap-card"><div class="card-body">
        You give me a lift one Saturday, and nothing is expected back. That is a normal thing to ask for here.
      </div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-center text-muted small mt-4">
    AI-generated. A draft to edit before you post it. The swap ideas are options; the two people decide.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="text-center mt-5 pb-4">
  <% unless signed_in? %>
    <%= link_to "Write your own request &rarr;".html_safe, sign_up_path, class: "btn btn-primary" %>
  <% end %>
  <div class="mt-3 text-muted small">
    Open source &middot;
    <a href="https://unityoffers.com" class="text-muted">UnityOffers</a>
  </div>
</div>
